# Copy this to .env.local and fill in your own token to enable live Koios
# data in the browser. Without it, real (non-mock/replay) mode will fail
# with a CORS error - Koios's no-signup public tier doesn't send
# Access-Control-Allow-Origin on real responses, only on the OPTIONS
# preflight, so browsers refuse to read the response. See README.md.
#
# Get a free token (just connect a Cardano wallet and sign a message, no
# payment) at https://koios.rest - free registered tier, 50,000 req/day,
# not CORS-restricted.
#
# This gets baked into the static build as plain text (Vite only exposes
# VITE_-prefixed vars to client code, and does so by inlining them) -
# visible to anyone who inspects the deployed site, same as any
# client-embedded API key. Don't put a token here you're not OK exposing.
VITE_KOIOS_API_TOKEN=
